## Summary of Changes

| Area | Changes |
|------|---------|
| **src/api/modules/chats.js** | Added `updateMessage()` and `deleteMessage()` API endpoints |
| **src/store/chats.js** | Added `updateChatMessages` mutation; added `updateMessage()` and `deleteMessage()` actions; removed direct message manipulation from `addMessage()` |
| **src/service/chat.js** | Updated `removeMessage()`, `toggleHide()`, `toggleAnswer()`, `hideAll()`, `validateFile()`, and `sendChatMessage()` to use store actions instead of direct modifications |

All message operations now go through the API layer and store actions for proper state management and synchronization.

